I compared linux 3.14.61 to 3.14.79.  The Telit LE920A4 has been added
to option.c and the blacklists have been updated -

#define TELIT_PRODUCT_LE922_USBCFG5        0x1045
#define TELIT_PRODUCT_LE920            0x1200
#define TELIT_PRODUCT_LE910            0x1201
